<p>Best forVillas, hospitality, retail</p>
<p>Design languageBold, narrative-driven</p>
<p>BaseHyderabad, active pan-India</p>
<p>Urban Zen operates in the intersection of interior design and cultural storytelling. Founder Rohit Suraj is a TedX speaker and has been recognised among India's top interior designers and architects, and the firm's project footprint runs across Telangana, Karnataka, Andhra Pradesh, Gujarat and Kolkata. The signature here is unmistakable: layered materiality, sculptural moments, and a willingness to make interiors that argue for a point of view rather than dissolve into a neutral shell.</p>
<p>Best fit if you're commissioning a villa or holiday home and want the studio to actively shape the concept rather than execute yours.</p>
