<p>The Koncept House works almost exclusively in the villa and penthouse segment, with an in-house team of designers, architects and site supervisors. The firm's positioning is on personalised design paired with imported finishes and luxury textures, and its coverage map maps neatly onto Hyderabad's premium residential geography. What sets it apart from purely turnkey firms is the concept phase — the studio spends time on the design language before jumping to execution, which is often the missing step at this price point.</p>
