<p>Best fit for owners who want a home that is understated, environmentally considered and quietly expensive rather than loud.</p>
<h2>Category three: warranted turnkey firms</h2>
<p>These firms operate at scale, with standardised material libraries, factory production and multi-year written warranties. The best of them deliver premium finishes at predictable timelines and transparent costs — the trade-off is less bespoke design flexibility and a more prescribed workflow. If your priority is a defined budget, a written warranty, and a professionalised process, this is the category to shortlist.</p>
